    <item>
      <title>Bob the Builder theme song is a founder manifesto.</title>
      <link>https://tzukit.substack.com/p/bob-the-builder-theme-song-is-a-founder</link>
      <description>i gave this 1min lightning talk when i worked at MATS and once at an EA retreat.</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>i gave this 1min lightning talk when i worked at MATS and once at an EA retreat. </p><ul><li><p><a href="https://genius.com/Bob-the-builder-can-we-fix-it-lyrics">full lyrics</a> here, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HdVg-2jn2OU">actual song</a> here:</p></li></ul><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD6x!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7c89ccd-98be-4a76-a873-7760a1102459_311x461.png" target="_blank"><div class="image2-inset"><source type="image/webp"/><img alt="" class="sizing-normal" height="461" src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD6x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7c89ccd-98be-4a76-a873-7760a1102459_311x461.png" width="311"/><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M" tabindex="0" type="button"><svg class="icon-noB79L" fill="none" height="20" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M" tabindex="0" type="button"><svg class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>now my 4-part builder thesis:</p><ol><li><p><strong>fix what’s broken</strong> </p><ol><li><p>&gt; “can we fix it? … yes we can.”</p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong>find your friends</strong></p><ol><li><p>&gt; “[8* random names we’ll never remember]… join the crew”</p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong>make work fun**</strong> </p><ol><li><p>&gt; “Bob and the gang have so much fun”</p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong>get shit done!</strong></p><ol><li><p>&gt; “they get the job done”</p></li></ol><p></p></li></ol><p><em>RIGHT?!</em></p><p><em>footnotes:</em></p><ol><li><p><em>*8 </em>interestingly fits Amazon’s “two-pizza rule”, which states that an internal team should be small enough to be fed by just two pizzas, ~<strong>5 to 9 people</strong>.</p></li><li><p>**Ali Abdaal’s (the most subscribed productivity youtuber) book’s thesis in one line is just “make work feel fun”</p><ol><li><p>the book is also <a href="https://aliabdaal.com/feel-good-productivity/">endorsed by Will McAskill</a> (aka Big Mac) ;) </p></li></ol></li><li><p><em>lore:</em></p></li></ol><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><div class="image-link image2"><div class="image2-inset"><source type="image/webp"/><img alt="Byggare Bob | Berlin United 2 Wiki | Fandom" class="sizing-normal" height="50" src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!srh6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0825bba9-9644-4f98-8711-be5a4953bf3d_600x600.webp" title="Byggare Bob | Berlin United 2 Wiki | Fandom" width="50"/><div></div></div></div><figcaption class="image-caption">and that’s the forgettable lore behind my MATS Slack workspace status being a “Bob” head</figcaption></figure></div><ol start="3"><li><p><em>lore</em>:</p></li></ol><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><div class="image-link image2"><div class="image2-inset"><source type="image/webp"/><img alt="Ephéméride : Obama Président (2008) - 9 Lives Magazine" class="sizing-normal" height="207.31034482758622" src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iFRX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb48891f-981d-4652-9694-b0a408343c90_580x360.jpeg" title="Ephéméride : Obama Président (2008) - 9 Lives Magazine" width="334"/><div></div></div></div><figcaption class="image-caption">p.s. Bob got there in 1999. Obama got there in 2008; Bob got there first 😎</figcaption></figure></div>]]></content:encoded>
