      <title>being actually agentic 2</title>
      <link>https://tzukit.substack.com/p/being-actually-agentic-2</link>
      <description>u make a problem that's (slightly) bigger than yourself your frickin problem.</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GRe7!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c06e39d-2ab4-4c0f-a409-e1bdf33717eb_1000x1000.jpeg" target="_blank"><div class="image2-inset"><source type="image/webp"/><img alt="Funny Art Canvas Painting Wanderer Above The Sea of Fog Art Posters and  Prints Wall Pictures Cuadros for Home Living Room – buy the best products in  the Ayzeze online store" class="sizing-normal" height="532" src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GRe7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c06e39d-2ab4-4c0f-a409-e1bdf33717eb_1000x1000.jpeg" title="Funny Art Canvas Painting Wanderer Above The Sea of Fog Art Posters and  Prints Wall Pictures Cuadros for Home Living Room – buy the best products in  the Ayzeze online store" width="532"/><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M" tabindex="0" type="button"><svg class="icon-noB79L" fill="none" height="20" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M" tabindex="0" type="button"><svg class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L" fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">some call it “heroic responsibility”. </figcaption></figure></div><p>ideally, the (slightly) bigger problem u choose affects many others.</p><p>that’s it. </p><p>it’s not that deep. </p><p>now get back to work. </p><p>get your reps in fixing what’s broken with the world. </p><p></p>]]></content:encoded>
